{"id":"33e772381f9068fb","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SFmRow.md","title":"SFmRow","display":"SFmRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SFmRow","parameters":["F","R","f","r","z1431","z1432","z1433"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SFmRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>z1431</span><span>z1432</span><span>z1433</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>z1431</code>、<code>z1432</code>、<code>z1433</code>。</p>\n<p>个体变量与各元数关系变量分离；零元关系允许。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SFmRow F R f r z1431 z1432 z1433)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z1433 t)\n    (exists z1436\n      (and\n        (@ Num1 z1436)\n        (and\n          (@ FSig z1436 F R f r)\n          (or\n            (@ FFm z1436 F R f r t)\n            (or\n              (exists z1437\n                (exists z1438\n                  (exists z1439\n                    (and\n                      (@ Nat z1437)\n                      (and\n                        (@ Nat z1438)\n                        (and\n                          (@ SRelVar z1437 z1438 z1439 t)\n                          (and\n                            (@ Seq z1439 z1437)\n                            (forall z1440\n                            (implies (in z1440 z1437) (exists z1441 (and (@ App z1439 z1440 z1441) (@ FTerm F f z1441))))))))))))\n              (or\n                (exists z1442\n                  (and\n                    (@ PNeg z1442 t)\n                    (exists z1445 (exists z1446 (and (in z1445 z1432) (and (@ App z1431 z1445 z1446) (= z1446 z1442)))))))\n                (or\n                  (exists z1442\n                    (exists z1443\n                      (and\n                        (@ PImp z1442 z1443 t)\n                        (and\n                          (exists z1447 (exists z1448 (and (in z1447 z1432) (and (@ App z1431 z1447 z1448) (= z1448 z1442)))))\n                          (exists z1449 (exists z1450 (and (in z1449 z1432) (and (@ App z1431 z1449 z1450) (= z1450 z1443)))))))))\n                  (or\n                    (exists z1444\n                      (exists z1442\n                        (and\n                          (@ Nat z1444)\n                          (and\n                            (@ FAll z1444 z1442 t)\n                            (exists z1451 (exists z1452 (and (in z1451 z1432) (and (@ App z1431 z1451 z1452) (= z1452 z1442)))))))))\n                    (exists z1437\n                      (exists z1438\n                        (exists z1442\n                          (and\n                            (@ Nat z1437)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Nat z1438)\n                            (and\n                            (@ SAll z1437 z1438 z1442 t)\n                            (exists z1453 (exists z1454 (and (in z1453 z1432) (and (@ App z1431 z1453 z1454) (= z1454 z1442)))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\"ZFC_FFm\">FFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"50085369706c1ec8\" href=\"?note=50085369706c1ec8\" title=\"ZFC_FSig\">FSig</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"21487f65c94a2183\" href=\"?note=21487f65c94a2183\" title=\"ZFC_FTerm\">FTerm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"aa9c9cb978b3cbf4\" href=\"?note=aa9c9cb978b3cbf4\" title=\"ZFC_SAll\">SAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b10bd78951872ea5\" href=\"?note=b10bd78951872ea5\" title=\"ZFC_SRelVar\">SRelVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SFmRow F R f r z1431 z1432 z1433)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZF